OL,3,AGasps as Prince William makes surprise
OL,4,Aappearance on Graham Norton Show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince of Wales has made a surprise
OL,7,Fappearance on the Graham Norton Show,
OL,8,Fas part of a special edition to mark
OL,9,Fthe Earthshot Prize.
OL,11,FDuring the episode, which airs on
OL,12,FFriday, he joined Cate Blanchett,
OL,13,FRobert Irwin and Hannah Waddingham, who
OL,14,Fare all involved with the prize.
OL,16,FAs Norton spoke about the initiative
OL,17,Fwith the trio he surprised the audience
OL,18,Fby then inviting the prince out to join
OL,19,Fthem on the sofa, to cheers and gasps
OL,20,Ffrom the audience.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
