OL,3,AGasps as Prince William makes surprise
OL,4,Aappearance on Graham Norton Show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey discussed the need to pair
OL,7,Foptimism and urgency when tackling
OL,8,Fclimate change. The prize was founded
OL,9,Fby William to "celebrate and scale the
OL,10,Fsolutions that will repair our planet".
